OL,3,AYouth charged after shopping centre
OL,4,Aattack leaves teenager in hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager has been charged after an
OL,7,Fattack involving a groups of youths
OL,8,Finside a Glasgow shopping centre left
OL,9,Fanother teenager needing hospital
OL,10,Ftreatment.
OL,12,FVideo posted on social media shows a
OL,13,Fyoung man, who was using a crutch and
OL,14,Fwearing a medical boot, being knocked
OL,15,Fto the ground, then repeatedly punched
OL,16,Fand kicked inside the St Enoch Centre
OL,17,Fon Friday afternoon.
OL,19,FA second person was also pushed to the
OL,20,Fground during the disturbance but
OL,21,Fsecurity staff intervened.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
