OL,3,AYouth charged after shopping centre
OL,4,Aattack leaves teenager in hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice Scotland said a 19-year-old was
OL,7,Ftaken to hospital and a 17-year-old boy
OL,8,Fwas later arrested and charged
OL,9,Ffollowing investigations.
